<p><strong>SOURCES:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>The paintings are by <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vilhelm_Hammersh%C3%B8i">Vilhelm Hammershøi</a> (a Danish painter known for his low-key style), edited by me; each is CC compliant. Links <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vilhelm_Hammersh%C3%B8i_-_Interior_with_a_mirror_(ca.1907).jpg">here</a>, <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/147316538@N02/35378633541/">here</a>, <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/eoskins/37125109704">here</a>, <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vilhelm_Hammersh%C3%B8i_-_The_Collector_of_Coins_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg">here</a>, and <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vilhelm_Hammersh%C3%B8i_-_Interior_from_the_Home_of_the_Artist_-_A_III_2058_-_Finnish_National_Gallery.jpg">here</a>.</li>
<li>I've modified the last painting using the image from <a href="https://pixabay.com/en/frosted-glass-disc-741503/">here</a>.</li>
<li>Inspired by the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hinterkaifeck_murders">Hinterkaifeck murders</a> and <em><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Reaper%27s_Image">The Reaper's Image</a></em> (a short story by Stephen King).</li>
<li>Code stolen from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3009022); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561553942" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3009022); return false;">not_a_seagull</a></span>'s <a href="/scp-4948">SCP-4948</a>.</li>
</ul>
